	Help = "<gray>Once a second, the AI reads the rows from top to bottom. Each action has a kind: Target, Move, Fire, Face, Trade, Build or Flags. "\
	       "For each kind, the first row that matches wins, and a green number marks it; every matching flag row runs. A condition is a fact (yes or no) or a value "\
	       "compared with a number or another value: pick its group, then the entry. A row can have any number of conditions, joined by AND and OR; AND goes first, and brackets change the order. "\
	       "Each weapon group follows its first Fire row that matches. A weapon group is a part control group (1 to 10) of the ship. "\
	       "Ctrl+K opens this window.</gray>"
